  "name": "Season Rotator",
  "slug": "season-rotator",
  "teaser": "Auto-rotate seasons at the pace you decide ",
  "thumbnail": "https://forge-static.sp-tarkov.com/mods/Q6cdWWZz218XBB4wGhXtyDDc7wPihWS6vUeGAwMc.jpg",
  "downloads": 26465,
  "favourites_count": 45,
  "description": "<p>A very simple mod that automatically changes seasons.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>When first installed, the timer starts on the day of the first run.</li>\n<li>The first season will be whichever season comes next after your current one. For example, if you play vanilla SPT without season-changing mods and your current season is summer, the mod will switch to early autumn, then to late autumn, then to winter and so on</li>\n<li>In 2.0.0 (SPT 4.0) version, default setting is ~7 days for offseasons and ~14 days for winter and summer, you can change it in the config. The SPT 3.11 version is 7 days for each season.</li>\n<li>Not compatible with other season-changing mods (and not intended to be)</li>\n<li>Runs only when SPT server starts - so no season change in-game in edge cases</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p>This mod is meant to be simple. If you need more flexebility, you should probably use some of these mods:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2796-tarkov-weather-system/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Tarkov Weather System</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2807-time-weather-changer-ng/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Time &amp; Weather Changer NG</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/files/file/2118-simple-season-selector/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Simple Season Selector</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
