      "description": "<p>2.0.0 version changes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Moved the mod to C# / SPT 4.0</li>\n<li>Instead of switching the season every 7 days, added lengths for each one. Winter and summer are slightly less than 2 weeks while offseasons (autumn, autumn_late, spring, spring_early) are about 7 days as previously.</li>\n<li>Setting some season’s length to 0 will result in ignoring this season</li>\n</ul>\n",
